{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10391","headline":"题尉迟将军新庙 · 高适","name":"题尉迟将军新庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周室既板荡，贼臣立婴儿。\n将军独激昂，誓欲酬恩私。\n孤城日无援，高节终可悲。\n家国共沦亡，精魂空在斯。\n沈沈积冤气，寂寂无人知。\n良牧怀深仁，与君建明祠。\n父子俱血食，轩车每逶迤。\n我来荐苹蘩，感叹兴此词。\n晨光上阶闼，杀气翻旌旗。\n明明幽冥理，至诚信莫欺。\n唯夫二千石，多庆方自兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}